# The build context of the API image (Containerfile), as an allowlist: only what the image copies.
# Everything else stays out, among it .git, .venv, web/, node_modules, roadmap/ and caches.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!src/
!migrations/

# Never, not even inside the directories above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
